WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.097 --> 00:00:01.494
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.445 --> 00:00:04.003
Every stand is squeaking and wobbling!

3
00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:07.181
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:07.181 --> 00:00:09.647
This is Episode 67.

5
00:00:09.647 --> 00:00:11.815
Meet the magic toolbox.

6
00:00:11.815 --> 00:00:14.396
Maya does not fix them one by one.

7
00:00:14.396 --> 00:00:16.518
She opens the toolbox.

8
00:00:16.518 --> 00:00:17.723
Whoosh!

9
00:00:17.723 --> 00:00:20.522
Sparkles fly to every stand at once.

10
00:00:20.522 --> 00:00:22.369
Squeak... gone!

11
00:00:22.369 --> 00:00:25.363
The toolbox can peek inside every stand.

12
00:00:25.363 --> 00:00:26.602
Pitcher?

13
00:00:26.602 --> 00:00:27.852
Cups?

14
00:00:27.852 --> 00:00:29.251
Lemons?

15
00:00:29.251 --> 00:00:31.052
Maya sees it all.

16
00:00:31.052 --> 00:00:33.117
This one has no cups.

17
00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:34.310
Tap!

18
00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:35.859
Cups appear.

19
00:00:35.859 --> 00:00:39.839
At night, while Maya sleeps, the toolbox works on its own.

20
00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.283
Polish, tighten, fix.

21
00:00:42.283 --> 00:00:43.590
Morning!

22
00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:45.598
Every stand shines.

23
00:00:45.598 --> 00:00:48.970
One toolbox, every stand, all at once.

24
00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:51.288
That is the magic toolbox.

25
00:00:51.288 --> 00:00:54.213
Now you know AWS Systems Manager!

26
00:00:54.213 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

